<view class="page member-code-page">
  <view class="code-card">
    <view class="code-brand">TGG SHOP</view>
    <view class="title">门店会员码</view>
    <view class="muted code-caption">结账时向收银员出示</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="code-state"><view>登录后查看你的会员码</view><button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="goLogin">去登录</button></view>
    <view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="code-state">会员码加载中…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{error || message}}" class="code-state"><view>{{error || message}}</view><button wx:if="{{message}}" class="btn btn-primary" open-type="contact">联系客服核对</button><button class="btn btn-light" bindtap="load">{{message ? '已处理，重新查询' : '重新加载'}}</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{number}}" class="code-content">
      <canvas id="member-barcode" type="2d" class="barcode" hidden="{{!!barcodeError}}"></canvas>
      <view wx:if="{{barcodeError}}" class="code-state">{{barcodeError}}<button class="btn btn-light" bindtap="load">重试</button></view>
      <text class="card-number" selectable>{{number}}</text>
      <view class="muted">无法扫码时，可由收银员输入卡号</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="code-tips"><view>使用说明</view><view>请收银员先打开会员识别输入框，再扫描上方条形码。</view><view>请使用支持手机屏幕识读的扫码枪，并适当提高屏幕亮度。</view><view>此码用于识别门店会员，不用于付款；门店权益以收银系统为准。</view></view>
</view>
